om/_next/static/media/feat_6.b3c69c8f.webp"/></div><div class="flex-1 md:flex-none"><h3 class="text-[0.34rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-[#2D2C40] md:text-[18px]">Easy to Use</h3><p class="mt-[0.14rem] text-[0.24rem] leading-[1.55] text-[--text-tertiary] md:mt-[10px] md:text-[16px]">Simply copy the Instagram link, paste it into the downloader, and click download. Your file will be ready in seconds.</p></div></article></div></section></div><section class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1310px] flex-col gap-[0.4rem] px-[0.25rem] md:gap-[40px] md:px-0"><h2 class="mb-[0.16rem] text-center text-[0.44rem] font-bold text-[#2D3436] md:mb-[20px] md:text-[44px]">SaveFromIns Downloader</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[0.3rem] md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-[30px]"><div class="flex h-auto flex-col-reverse md:flex-col justify-between rounded-[0.2rem] p-[0.4rem] text-white md:rounded-[20px] md:p-[40px] bg-[#E67CF0]"><div class="md:h-[200px]"><h3 class="mb-[0.2rem] text-[0.36rem] font-bold md:mb-[20px] md:text-[32px]">Save Instagram Videos</h3><p class="text-[0.26rem] leading-[1.6] opacity-90 md:text-[18px]">Download high-quality MP4 videos directly to your device. SaveFromIns preserves the original resolution, ensuring crisp offline playback.</p></div><div class=""><img alt="Save Instagram Videos" loading="lazy" width="1120" height="720" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="aspect-[560/360] w-full object-contain md:h-auto md:w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/card-image-vidieo-1.0227c1ad.webp"/></div></div><div class="flex h-auto flex-col-reverse md:flex-col justify-between rounded-[0.2rem] p-[0.4rem] text-white md:rounded-[20px] md:p-[40px] bg-[#D47CF0]"><div class="md:h-[200px]"><h3 class="mb-[0.2rem] text-[0.36rem] font-bold md:mb-[20px] md:text-[32px]">Online Video Downloader</h3><p class="text-[0.26rem] leading-[1.6] opacity-90 md:text-[18px]">No app or software required. Works in your browser on PC, Mac, Android, and iOS. Just paste the link and get your video instantly.</p></div><div class=""><img alt="Online Video Downloader" loading="lazy" width="1120" height="720" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="aspect-[560/360] w-full object-contain md:h-auto md:w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/card-image-igtv-2.0e21e4fb.webp"/></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-[#F9F9FE] pb-[1.2rem] pt-[0.6rem] md:mt-[60px] md:pb-[60px]"><section class="mx-auto max-w-[1310px] overflow-hidden px-[0.25rem] md:px-0"><h2 class="my-[0.4rem] text-center text-[0.44rem] font-extrabold text-[#1C4B70FF] md:mb-[40px] md:mt-[60px] md:text-[44px]">Frequently asked questions (FAQ)</h2><p class="mx-auto mb-[0.4rem] mt-[-0.2rem] text-center text-[0.24rem] text-[#2D3436FF] md:mb-[40px] md:mt-[-20px] md:w-[983px] md:text-[14px]">This FAQ provides information on frequent questions or concerns about the SaveFromIns Downloader. If you can&#x27;t find the answer to your question, feel free to ask through email on our contact page.</p><div class="mx-auto mb-[0.24rem] w-[6.7rem] rounded-[0.2rem] bg-white px-[0.4rem] py-[0.3rem] shadow-[0px_4px_20px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] md:mb-[20px] md:w-[983px] md:rounded-[20px] md:px-[40px] md:py-[30px]"><details class="group"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><div class="w-[6.34rem] text-[0.3rem] font-bold text-[#2D3436FF] md:w-fit md:text-[24px]">What is an Instagram Video Downloader?</div><div class="relative"><img alt="open" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:hidden md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px] rotate-180" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/><img alt="close" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="hidden h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:block md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px]" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/></div></summary><div class="mt-[0.3rem] w-[6.34rem] text-[0.24rem] font-bold leading-[0.4rem] text-[#1C4B70FF] md:mt-[30px] md:w-fit md:text-[18px] md:leading-[30px]">Instagram doesn’t provide an online tool for downloading video files. SaveFromIns is a free web tool that helps users save their favorite Instagram videos. Copy the video link, paste it into SaveFromIns, and click Download.</div></details></div><div class="mx-auto mb-[0.24rem] w-[6.7rem] rounded-[0.2rem] bg-white px-[0.4rem] py-[0.3rem] shadow-[0px_4px_20px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] md:mb-[20px] md:w-[983px] md:rounded-[20px] md:px-[40px] md:py-[30px]"><details class="group"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><div class="w-[6.34rem] text-[0.3rem] font-bold text-[#2D3436FF] md:w-fit md:text-[24px]">Are there any limits on the number of videos I can download?</div><div class="relative"><img alt="open" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:hidden md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px] rotate-180" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/><img alt="close" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="hidden h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:block md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px]" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/></div></summary><div class="mt-[0.3rem] w-[6.34rem] text-[0.24rem] font-bold leading-[0.4rem] text-[#1C4B70FF] md:mt-[30px] md:w-fit md:text-[18px] md:leading-[30px]">There’s no limit to how many videos you can download with SaveFromIns. Copy, paste, and download as many times as you like.</div></details></div><div class="mx-auto mb-[0.24rem] w-[6.7rem] rounded-[0.2rem] bg-white px-[0.4rem] py-[0.3rem] shadow-[0px_4px_20px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] md:mb-[20px] md:w-[983px] md:rounded-[20px] md:px-[40px] md:py-[30px]"><details class="group"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><div class="w-[6.34rem] text-[0.3rem] font-bold text-[#2D3436FF] md:w-fit md:text-[24px]">Can I choose different video resolutions/qualities?</div><div class="relative"><img alt="open" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:hidden md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px] rotate-180" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/><img alt="close" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="hidden h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:block md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px]" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/></div></summary><div class="mt-[0.3rem] w-[6.34rem] text-[0.24rem] font-bold leading-[0.4rem] text-[#1C4B70FF] md:mt-[30px] md:w-fit md:text-[18px] md:leading-[30px]">Yes. SaveFromIns supports multiple resolutions. Depending on the original quality, you can often choose 1080p, 720p, or 480p to fit your storage and data needs.</div></details></div><div class="mx-auto mb-[0.24rem] w-[6.7rem] rounded-[0.2rem] bg-white px-[0.4rem] py-[0.3rem] shadow-[0px_4px_20px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] md:mb-[20px] md:w-[983px] md:rounded-[20px] md:px-[40px] md:py-[30px]"><details class="group"><summary class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between"><div class="w-[6.34rem] text-[0.3rem] font-bold text-[#2D3436FF] md:w-fit md:text-[24px]">What video file format does SaveFromIns use?</div><div class="relative"><img alt="open" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:hidden md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px] rotate-180" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/><img alt="close" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="hidden h-[0.4rem] w-[0.4rem] group-open:block md:h-[30px] md:w-[30px]" style="color:transparent" src="https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/faq_icon.a45c6457.webp"/></div></summary><div class="mt-[0.3rem] w-[6.34rem] text-[0.24rem] font-bold leading-[0.4rem] text-[#1C4B70FF] md:mt-[30px] md:w-fit md:text-[18px] md:leading-[30px]">MP4 is widely supported and offers excellent quality with small file sizes. All downloads are provided in MP4 format.</div></details></div></section></div><div class="hidden flex-col items-start bg-white py-8 md:flex"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-wrap gap-12 gap-y-[30px] px-8"><div class="flex flex-col"><div title="savefromins.org" class="mb-6 h-[50px] w-[325px] text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400" style="background:url(&quot;https://web-res.savefromins.com/savefromins-com/_next/static/media/logo-color.a3deaef4.webp&quot;) no-repeat center/contain"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="mb-4 text-[16px] font-bold text-[#1a1a1a]">Instagram Downloader</div><a class="mb-2 text-[14px] text-[#666666] hover:text-[#1a1a1a] hover:underline" href="/video">Instagram Video Downloader</a><a class="mb-2 text-[14px] text-[#666666] hover:text-[#1a1a1a] hover:underline" href="/reels">Instagram Reels Downloader</a><a class="mb-2 text-[14px] text-[#666666] hover:text-[#1a1a1a] hover:underline" href="/photo">Instagram Photo Downloader</a><a class="mb-2 text-[14px] text-[#666666] hover:text-[#1a1a1a] hover:underline" href="/story">Instagram Stories Downloader</a><a class="mb-2 text-[14px] text-[#666666] hover:text-[#1a1a1a] hover:underline" href="/igtv">Instagram IGTV Downloader</a><a class="mb-2 text-[14px] text-[#666666] hover:text-[#1a1a1a] hover:underline" href="/carousel">Instagram Carousel Downloader</a><a class=