m to your Gallery and keep them forever.\"},{\"title\":\"Is it possible to download Stories from a computer?\",\"description\":\"Of course. You can use SaveFromIns on your PC or Mac to save Stories. Just paste the link, and the stories will be saved to your computer easily.\"},{\"title\":\"Do I need to log in to view or download Stories?\",\"description\":\"No, there is no need to log in. You can use our tool to download public Stories without connecting your Instagram account.\"},{\"title\":\"Can I download Highlights as well?\",\"description\":\"Yes! Highlights are just Stories that have been saved to a profile. As long as the account is public, SaveFromIns can download them for you.\"},{\"title\":\"Is this service free?\",\"description\":\"Yes, SaveFromIns Stories Downloader is completely free to use. You can save as many stories as you like.\"}],\"howTo\":{\"title\":\"How to download Instagram story?\",\"mobile\":{\"label\":\"Steps to Download from Mobile App\",\"steps\":[\"Open Instagram and view the \u003chighlight\u003eStories\u003c/highlight\u003e you want to save.\",\"Tap the \u003chighlight\u003eShare\u003c/highlight\u003e option and select \u003chighlight\u003eCopy Link\u003c/highlight\u003e.\",\"Open SaveFromIns.com in your browser, paste the stories link, and tap \u003chighlight\u003eDownload\u003c/highlight\u003e to save it.\"]},\"desktop\":{\"label\":\"Steps to Download from Desktop\",\"steps\":[\"Open Instagram in your browser and navigate to the stories you want to download.\",\"Copy the stories link from the address bar.\",\"Paste the link into SaveFromIns.com and click \u003chighlight\u003eDownload\u003c/highlight\u003e once the stories preview appears.\"]}}},\"carousel\":{\"title\":\"Instagram Carousel Downloader – Download Multiple IG Photos\",\"desc\":\"Download Instagram carousel posts with SaveFromIns. Save all photos and videos from a single IG post at once in original quality—fast, free, and simple.\",\"keyword\":\"Instagram carousel downlo